# 3-tier FatTree, 64 nodes, 1:1 (non-oversubscribed) — derived from fat_tree_128_1os.topo
# Same pod structure (podsize 16) but 4 pods instead of 8, so core down-radix = 4.
Nodes 64
Tiers 3
Podsize 16

Tier 0
Oversubscribed 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 4
Radix_Up 4
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0

Tier 1
Oversubscribed 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 4
Radix_Up 4
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Bundle 1

Tier 2
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 4
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Bundle 1